      "summary": ": Thursday 06/08 We are open today with a mainly fine day ahead, low winds, and clear skies to start with. We may see some high cloud rolling later this afternoon. The grooming this morning is as good as it gets with wide trails thanks to the recent snow fall! Main Basin lifts will be running from 08:30am with Captains, Soho, T-Bar, and Willows will follow from 09:00am The road is chain free, please turn your head lights on. The road is dusty at the moment due to the extremely low humidity, please take care. Passes: Everyone with a season's pass will need a picture on their profile/pass this year. If you're unsure if you have one, pop into any Guest Services location and they will be able to sort you out.",
